# The Flutter tool generates everything under windows/flutter/ephemeral/ during
# a build (flutter_windows.dll, icudtl.dat, generated_config.cmake, the C++
# wrapper sources, ...). Never commit it.
#
# NOTE: 需与官方模板核对 — 官方 `flutter create --platforms=windows` 生成的
# windows/.gitignore 只有下面这一行规则，没有这段注释。
flutter/ephemeral/
